<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Dashboard | Kellie's Green Farms</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:Arial;background:#03170f;color:white;min-height:100vh}
header{padding:20px 6%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#08271a;border-bottom:1px solid #24f58a33}
.logo{color:#24f58a;font-weight:bold}
header a{color:#24f58a;text-decoration:none}
main{padding:40px 6%;max-width:1100px;margin:auto}
.welcome{color:#24f58a;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px}
h1{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:10px}
.subtitle{color:#abc5b5;margin-bottom:35px}
.balance{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0b4027,#092719);padding:30px;border-radius:17px;border:1px solid #24f58a66;box-shadow:0 0 25px #24f58a17;margin-bottom:35px}
.balance p{color:#b6d5c2;font-size:14px}
.balance h2{font-size:36px;color:#24f58a;margin-top:12px}
.packages{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px}
.package{background:#092719;border:1px solid #24f58a33;padding:25px;border-radius:14px}
.package h3{color:#24f58a;margin-bottom:12px}
.package p{color:#b6d5c2;font-size:14px;line-height:2}
.notice{color:#91ac9b;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:25px}
@media(max-width:600px){.packages{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:24px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">🌱 KELLIE'S GREEN FARMS</div>
<a href="/logout">Logout ↗</a>
</header>
<main>
<div class="welcome">YOUR FARM ACCOUNT</div>
<h1>Welcome, {{ fullname }}!</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Welcome to your Kellie's Green Farms dashboard.</p>

<div class="balance">
<p>AVAILABLE ACCOUNT BALANCE</p>
<h2>₦{{ "{:,.2f}".format(balance|float) }}</h2>
</div>

<h2 style="margin-bottom:20px">Agricultural Packages</h2>

<div class="packages">
<div class="package">
<h3>BIG SEED</h3>
<p>Capital: ₦10,000</p>
<p>Illustrative profit: ₦3,000</p>
<p>Duration: 30 days</p>
</div>

<div class="package">
<h3>MEDIUM</h3>
<p>Capital: ₦5,000</p>
<p>Illustrative profit: ₦1,500</p>
<p>Duration: 30 days</p>
</div>

<div class="package">
<h3>SMALL</h3>
<p>Capital: ₦2,000</p>
<p>Illustrative profit: ₦600</p>
<p>Duration: 30 days</p>
</div>

<div class="package">
<h3>STARTER</h3>
<p>Capital: ₦1,000</p>
<p>Illustrative profit: ₦300</p>
<p>Duration: 30 days</p>
</div>
</div>

<p class="notice">
Profit figures are illustrative, not guaranteed. Agricultural
activities involve risks, including possible loss of capital.
Review the business terms before making any financial commitment.
</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
